{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SPELLCAST is a fusion of card battlers and word games. Construct your deck with runes and bonuses, then play words on a grid to use them in battle. The power of your spells changes based on the words and letters you play, making each turn a delicate balance of wizardry and wordplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow more powerful by optimizing your runes and bonuses, collecting artifacts, and upgrading your tiles. Runes also have multiple upgrades that can enhance or greatly change their effects, for a wide variety of deckbuilding possibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle your way through 10 unique scenarios, or play the campaign for a more traditional roguelite experience. Increase the difficulty of either mode by tackling higher Danger Levels!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3821120?t=1773849659","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821120/6c71f2e7d2ed93d5252ad0a98a93467a8395d36b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773849659","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821120/5f15ca04748688143a21048c1e81b51e86e6008c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773849659","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821120/5f15ca04748688143a21048c1e81b51e86e6008c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773849659","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4001290,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SPELLCAST is a fusion of card battlers and word games. Construct your deck with runes and bonuses, then play words on a grid to use them in battle. The power of your spells changes based on the words and letters you play, making each turn a delicate balance of wizardry and wordplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow more powerful by optimizing your runes and bonuses, collecting artifacts, and upgrading your tiles. Runes also have multiple upgrades that can enhance or greatly change their effects, for a wide variety of deckbuilding possibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle your way through 10 unique scenarios, or play the campaign for a more traditional roguelite experience. Increase the difficulty of either mode by tackling higher Danger Levels!</p>","developers":["BEDiBUG Concepts"],"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821120/7dad74bad6ab329cf41721e7b0ce8d996c6385f3/header.jpg?t=1773849659","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3821120/2067544772/97c332482f0fe97f86cb773d6d010fb01be6f380/1771519167/dash_av1.mpd?t=1771521120","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3821120/2067544772/97c332482f0fe97f86cb773d6d010fb01be6f380/1771519167/dash_h264.mpd?t=1771521120","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3821120/2067544772/97c332482f0fe97f86cb773d6d010fb01be6f380/1771519167/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1771521120","id":257290265,"name":"Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257290265/ad89dd2d7bd4a1d55c2ae7a82c9080b69436c